'''METAL BUSTERS''' (メタルバスターズ ''Metarubasutāzu'') is one of the Rare Cat Capsule events in Battle Cats. This event contains [[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|anti-Metal]] and [[:Category:Critter-class Cats|critical hitter]] Uber Rare Cats from other events. It also features [[Neneko (Super Rare Cat)|Neneko]] and her seasonal variants. This event was added to BCJP in [[Version 6.4 Update|Version 6.4]], and is now currently available for BCEN as of Sept. 22. 2017.

==Chances==
{{GachaChances
|UberChance = 5%
|SuperChance = 25%
|RareChance = 70%
}}

